script 20 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = BrainyHertz
	"키자마로의 위저드,\n피디아는 정말 대단해!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"웬만한 건 뭐든\n눈 깜짝할 사이에 알아내거든."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
